Package: MaxEntTools
Type: Package
Title: Tools and Pipelines for MaxEnt Species Distribution Modelling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Alan", "Vincent",
      email = "alan.vincent@anu.edu.au",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Consolidated tools and pipelines for MaxEnt species distribution
    modelling. Includes functions for background area and bias layer
    generation, occurrence record thinning, model generation via ENMeval,
    model validation and null model testing, and future climate prediction
    workflows.
